<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="320ebfc4">&lt;h4&gt;
    These criteria confirm the elements contained within an organization&apos;s case for change have been satisfied.
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Is the executive summary complete?&lt;/strong&gt; 
        &lt;div style=&quot;MARGIN-LEFT: 2em&quot;&gt;
            Does this section provide a high level summary of the current situation, problem and recommended solution? 
            &lt;ul&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    What is the current situation? (indisputable facts)
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    What is triggering the change to the current situation?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    What must be done/solved?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    How do we propose to solve it?
                &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Is the background complete?&lt;/strong&gt; 
        &lt;div style=&quot;MARGIN-LEFT: 2em&quot;&gt;
            Does this section set context for the change by describing the company’s situation, the events that have shaped
            the current environment and how this has contributed to the reason for this initiative 
            &lt;ul&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    What is indisputably and incontrovertibly known about the company’s current situation?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    What, if anything, has the company done to address the current situation?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    What conclusions can be drawn about the current situation?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    How would we assess the outcome if nothing is done?
                &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Current situation&lt;/strong&gt; 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                What role does leadership have in influencing the current state?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                What level of integration/collaboration exists across the organization? What is needed?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                How is performance measured and rewarded?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                To what degree are roles &amp; responsibilities known and defined?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                To what degree do workforce skills and capabilities align to organizational requirements?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                How are IT or business processes affecting the current state?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                How is the organization structured?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                What is the current system landscape, and how does it affect the current state?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                How does information travel throughout the organization?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                How flexible/responsive to change is the company, its employees, its leadership?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                What is our competitive position in the industry?
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Drivers of change&lt;/strong&gt; 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                What are the current market conditions? What predictions are being made about the future market conditions?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                What is the current competitive landscape? What predictions are being made about the future competitive
                landscape?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                How does the change fit within the company’s vision?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                What role does/will technology play?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                How have/will changes to regulatory or statutory requirements affect the situation?
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                How scalable must the company be?
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Consequences of &apos;doing nothing&apos;&lt;/strong&gt; 
        &lt;div style=&quot;MARGIN-LEFT: 2em&quot;&gt;
            Has the team considered impacts to: 
            &lt;ul&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Company’s reputation/brand?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Employee satisfaction?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Market share?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Customer satisfaction?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Productivity?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Cost effectiveness?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Scalability?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Service delivery?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Occupational safety?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Security?
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Data integrity?
                &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Future State and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt; 
        &lt;div style=&quot;MARGIN-LEFT: 2em&quot;&gt;
            Has the team tied client benefits to the company’s future vision, goals and objectives, with respect to the
            following? 
            &lt;ul&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Reputation/brand
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Employee satisfaction
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Market share
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Customer satisfaction
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Productivity
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Cost effectiveness
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Scalability
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Service delivery
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Occupational safety
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Security
                &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;
                    Data integrity
                &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
